# Normalize line endings: always store LF in git, always check out LF.
# This keeps local Windows builds byte-identical to the CI (Linux) builds
# and prevents CRLF/LF drift in text assets (OBJ, CSV, DSF text, scripts).
# Git auto-detects text; binary files (PNG, DSF, ZIP, EXE) are untouched.
* text=auto eol=lf
